schievous — yet still very cute. It would be amazing if her personality traits could be reflected in the artwork!  \n\n[Artwork Content]Please freely decide the character’s pose.\n\n[Usage of the Artwork]The commissioned artwork will be used as custom gifts for my channel members and for promotional purposes on social media. If your schedule allows, I would greatly appreciate it if you could consider this request. Thank you very much!\nIt’s best to separate the background and the character, and deliver the file in PSD format.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LERioYAzSn742f7QUFAj48nNu7213C8I", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@nekonrk/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2492124, "client_id": 2552124, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f70db7c/uploads/origins/e8d7df96-0500-49b9-84d4-26fc39959399?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53a02b0b82508ed17c9de1204c130463", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f70db7c/uploads/origins/e8d7df96-0500-49b9-84d4-26fc39959399?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53a02b0b82508ed17c9de1204c130463, https://si.imgix.net/2f70db7c/uploads/origins/e8d7df96-0500-49b9-84d4-26fc39959399?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=541b3ccc69cb69660f221046ba91ff51 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2f70db7c/uploads/origins/e8d7df96-0500-49b9-84d4-26fc39959399?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e241d66b840015af40469701239ce536 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f70db7c/uploads/origins/e8d7df96-0500-49b9-84d4-26fc39959399?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d8579d39563bd0d0d25e17b50ec9a589